#This example uses APEX configured by TAU with ompt or openmp support.

Example configuration with oneAPI:
$ ./configure -bfd=download -cc=icx -c++=icpx -level_zero -apex -zerosum -ompt
$ make install -j

To use this example:
$ make clean
$ make
$ OMP_NUM_THREADS=4 tau_exec -T serial,ompt -apex ./openmp_test


