# With independent APEX installation
If you already have an APEX installation, you need to enable APEX and also provide the path
 to the apex library.

As an example:
$ APEX_TAU=1 tau_exec -T serial -loadlib=/home/users/jalcaraz/apex/lib/libapex.so ./openmp_test
